Package: IowaDOTbasemaps
Type: Package
Title: Iowa DOT and CARTO Basemaps for Leaflet
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Guillermo", "Basulto-Elias", , "guillermobasulto@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5205-2190"))
Description: Adds live Iowa Department of Transportation vector basemaps to 
  Leaflet maps and Shiny map proxies. Keeps basemap rendering below ordinary 
  incident overlays, manages asynchronous layer removal, and provides catalog 
  inspection and refresh utilities.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: leaflet (>= 2.2.0), htmltools (>= 0.5.0), jsonlite, curl
Suggests: shiny, testthat (>= 3.2.0), htmlwidgets
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: no
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/gbasulto/IowaDOTbasemaps, https://gbasulto.github.io/IowaDOTbasemaps/
BugReports: https://github.com/gbasulto/IowaDOTbasemaps/issues
